<title>INDIA: India RBI to launch t-bills of various maturities.</title>
<headline>India RBI to launch t-bills of various maturities.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Tuesday said it planned to launch treasury bills of different maturities but did not give any further details.</p>
<p>The central bank said in its monetary policy for the first six months of 1997/98 (April-March) that government bonds and treasury bills would be eligible for repo transactions.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
